Cell["\<\
At the endpoint of a path there is one ray and no axis; at an interior vertex \
the two rays are the halves of the one axis:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3fc1bc4e-3471-4315-8534-5bb16567ef94"],

